    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "With three corners left in the December 7 Abu Dhabi Grand Prix (2025), Lando Norris found himself shaking inside his McLaren. His thoughts flashed back to the first time he saw F1 on TV, then to his parents’ "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "unconditional",
            "ref": "v-unconditional"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " support. He just couldn’t hold it in. Within half a mile, the 26-year-old was about to become an F1 world champion."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“I felt calm until three corners to go,” Norris said once the dust had "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "settled",
            "ref": "v-settle"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". “I didn’t think I would cry, but I did.” Tears rose again as he lifted the championship "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "trophy",
            "zh": "冠军奖杯"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It had really been a long journey for him."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Norris developed an interest in motorcycle racing as a young boy. He hoped to follow in the footsteps of racing star Valentino Rossi and compete on two wheels. But everything changed when his father took him and his brother to a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "karting",
            "zh": "卡丁车"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " race when he was seven. Norris soon showed his talent for the sport. He won "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "pole position",
            "zh": "赢得杆位"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in his first major national event at the age of eight. Over the next few years, he moved up from karting to F2, winning many championship titles along the way."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In 2018, McLaren brought Norris in as a reserve driver. In his first F1 season in 2019, Norris was immediately a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "match",
            "ref": "v-match"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for Carlos Sainz, one of McLaren’s top racers at the time. With his shy yet jokey personality and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "willingness",
            "ref": "v-willingness"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to show his true self on social media, he quickly became a fan favourite."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Norris didn’t achieve any victories during his first five seasons with McLaren. However, he grew a lot during those years, changing from a shy boy into a world-class driver. He finally took his first win after McLaren introduced a key car "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "upgrade",
            "ref": "v-upgrade"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " before the 2024 Miami Grand Prix. He went on to win three more victories, finishing the season as runner-up."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "One year later, Norris has continued to develop quickly. After clearing one challenge after another, he has finally reached the top of the motorsport world. As McLaren’s first driver’s champion since Lewis Hamilton in 2008, he is sure to have a place in F1 history."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "What’s next for Norris? Only time will tell, but the road ahead looks bright."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
